# Copy this file to .dev.vars (git-ignored) and paste your key. `wrangler dev`
# reads .dev.vars natively. For production, supply MAPTILER_KEY only to the
# guarded deploy command documented in README.md. Do not commit it or rely on a
# dashboard-entered value: checked-in Worker vars overwrite that value on deploy.
#
# MapTiler raster tiles power the guest venue map (ADR-006). This key is exposed to
# the guest's browser by design (it rides in tile URLs), so it is NOT a Worker
# secret — but it MUST be domain-restricted in the MapTiler dashboard to our
# origins. The viewer injects it into published pages at serve time (never baked
# into the immutable snapshot). Leave unset to serve the "Get directions" fallback.
MAPTILER_KEY=your_domain_restricted_maptiler_key_here
